# L. Fita, UBA/CIMA/IFAECI, MArch 2025
This is a new experimental development related to the CORDEX FPS URB RCC initiative focused in the enhancing of WRF capabilities when simulating in urban environments, which are:
 i.- Mangement of the urban related dimensions from the namelist
 ii.- Inclusion of a new WRF output called 'wrfurban_d[nn]' at auxhist12
 iii.- Getting state variables at the vetical discretization used in BEP and BEM urban modules
 iv.- Allow for the reading of individual urban fractions for each LCZ
 v.- Retrieval of some diagnostics within the urban canopy

See more details in the GIT repository
https://github.com/CORDEX-WRF-community/fps-urb-rcc/tree/main/urbanModule

